meno-paradox.logic.r3: argue/two-senses: P3 (S2): "knows" is taken as the man does not know even the subject, so he cannot say what he is looking for in P3 and as the man knows fully the answer to what he would enquire about where knows is used else, a reader says
meno-paradox.logic.r3: argue/two-senses: P2 (S2): "enquire" is taken as there is some need or point in his enquiring about it in P2 and as he is able to enquire about it at all where can_enquire is used else, a reader says
